   biggest first, and each band wears its KIND'S OWN CATEGORY — the same position
   the map pin and the register chip read, so a band, a square and a pin can never
   drift apart. A kind with nothing filed this month is left out rather than drawn
   as a zero band ({@see IncidentDashboard::kindShares}).

